<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Low Rise Jeans</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Demi Lovato</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">It's Not That Deep (Unless You Want It To Be)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2TsYglxwgycpzDRhXjiodv</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.061" end="00:16.061">Work</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.581" end="00:21.770">Tonight I came here to get it right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.770" end="00:25.966">And I get what I want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.966" end="00:30.188">Oh my, think we might've caught a vibe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.188" end="00:33.580">You'd die to see me undone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.580" end="00:37.688">My black G-string peeking out from the corners</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.688" end="00:42.015">Wanna snap it back like a rubber band</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.015" end="00:46.021">My head and my heart want to ge-get to know ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.021" end="00:50.080">But my lips and my hips, they got other plans</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.080" end="00:56.807">I'm in my low rise jeans (Low rise, work)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.807" end="00:58.563">You don't need your imagination</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.563" end="01:05.156">I'm in my see-through tee (See-through shirt)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.156" end="01:09.153">I can feel your anticipation, pushing up on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.153" end="01:13.629">Pressing up on me passionately (Work)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.629" end="01:17.563">I can feel your anticipation, pushing up on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.563" end="01:21.800">Pressing up on me passionately</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.800" end="01:24.982">In my low rise jeans (Work)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.982" end="01:29.191">Don't stop every time you hit the spot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.191" end="01:33.203">Eyes back, focus on me (Focus on me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.203" end="01:37.599">So hot, damn, I'm liking this a lot</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.599" end="01:40.991">Eyes crossed, I'm such a tease</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.991" end="01:44.998">My black G-string peeking out from the corners</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.998" end="01:49.394">Wanna snap it back like a rubber band</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.394" end="01:53.387">My head and my heart want to ge-get to know ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.387" end="01:57.447">But my lips and my hips, they got other plans</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.447" end="02:04.186">I'm in my low rise jeans (Low rise, work)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.186" end="02:05.962">You don't need your imagination</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.962" end="02:12.569">I'm in my see-through tee (See-through shirt)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.569" end="02:16.534">I can feel your anticipation, pushing up on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.534" end="02:20.979">Pressing up on me passionately (Work)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.979" end="02:24.947">I can feel your anticipation, pushing up on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.947" end="02:29.169">Pressing up on me passionately</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.169" end="02:32.087">In my low rise jeans (Work)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.087" end="02:35.721">Want you on me, so stop pretending</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.721" end="02:37.833">Yeah, stop pretending</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.833" end="02:40.362">I can feel your anticipation (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.362" end="02:44.021">What's underneath, nothing's forbidden</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.021" end="02:46.261">Nothing's forbidden</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.261" end="02:50.124">You don't need your imagination, I'm in my</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.124" end="02:56.802">I'm in my low rise jeans (Low rise, work)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.802" end="02:58.625">You don't need your imagination</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.625" end="03:05.196">I'm in my see-through tee (See-through shirt)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.196" end="03:09.146">I can feel your anticipation, pushing up on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.146" end="03:13.619">Pressing up on me passionately (Work)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.619" end="03:17.595">I can feel your anticipation, pushing up on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.595" end="03:21.824">Pressing up on me passionately</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:21.824" end="03:25.824">In my low rise jeans (Work)</p></div></body></tt>